Show the Navidrome music folders card only while Navidrome is connected.

Why: the profile page leaves "Music Folders" out of its section list unless
Navidrome is connected, but renders the card itself either way. Without a
Navidrome connection the card's read (`GET /api/v3/remotes/navidrome/folders`)
answers 400 REMOTE_NOT_CONFIGURED ("Navidrome is not connected"), and the
card shows "Music folder preferences could not be loaded." to every user of
an install without Navidrome. Seen 2026-10-25 on music.xarif.de, which runs
no Navidrome. The card now renders under the same `navidromeEnabled` the
section list uses, like the media accounts card, which hides itself when no
media server is connected.

Tests: new page test (folders card absent while Navidrome is not
connected, present once it is). The first fails without the change.
svelte-check: 0 errors; prettier and eslint clean on both files.

Remove when: upstream hides the card without a Navidrome connection.

